source 2003 Stam "On Montgomery-like representations for elliptic curves over GF(2^k)", Section 3.2, plus a1 = 1, plus b8 = a6, plus common-subexpression elimination
compute A = X2*X3
compute B = Z2*Z3
compute XX2 = X2^2
compute ZZ2 = Z2^2
compute X4 = XX2^2+a6*ZZ2^2
compute Z4 = XX2*ZZ2
compute X5 = Z1*(A^2+a6*B^2)
compute Z5 = X1*((X2+Z2)*(X3+Z3)-A-B)^2
